<title>NEW ZEALAND: Latest table of NZ budget forecasts.</title>
<headline>Latest table of NZ budget forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the forecast New Zealand government operating balance for the current year and the next three fiscal years released by Treasury on Thursday as part of its pre-election Economic and Fiscal Update:</p>
<p>(in billions of New Zealand dollars):</p>
<p>		  1996/97	 1997/98     1998/99	 1999/00</p>
<p>Revenue	   35.63	    35.46	  36.85	38.45</p>
<p>Expenses	  32.92	    32.78	  32.90	32.85</p>
<p>Surplus	    2.87	     3.39	   4.70	 6.42</p>
<p>Surplus/GDP(pct) 3.1		3.5	    4.6	  5.9</p>
<p>Net worth	  6.21	     9.60	  14.30	20.72</p>
</text>
